                          "index":  0,
                          "text":  "There are two of us here. I am Sojourner, the little rover. The big one with the petals is my lander, Pathfinder. We do not like to be separated, so we will tell this together.\n\nWe arrived on July 4, 1997, in a way nobody had tried before. No gentle rocket landing. We were wrapped in giant airbags and simply dropped. We bounced at least 15 times, rolled, and stopped. Then the airbags went flat, the petals opened, and there was Mars.",
